    "updated_at": "2024-08-20T07:19:36Z",
    "body": "> In Firefox I cannot find evidence of this being in the UA stylesheet, but instead these properties seem to show up as applied to <meter> in some other way.\r\n\r\nFirefox seems to define some of these (like the `vertical-align` and the fallback gradients) in [forms.css](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/layout/style/res/forms.css#707)",
