    "updated_at": "2024-08-23T13:01:00Z",
    "body": "The suggested changes make sense to me and seems in line with what CSS UI expects.\r\n\r\nLast I checked there was no standardized pseudo-element for `meter`. That seems necessary to specify the primitive appearance (and allow authors to change the style without relying on vendor-prefixed pseudos).",
